            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81826728?u=d03b44099c9b5f754f72f273c30c26ceacf94377&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">the default cache directory is set to the <code class=\"notranslate\">constants.py</code>'s directory (under /nix/store/ obviously) if <code class=\"notranslate\">CACHE_DIR</code> environment variable is not present</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">calibre-web server will return 500 for all the book covers</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/janeczku/calibre-web/blob/91e36b2c7e1016de5f6b8d90201685ded51f7e0a/cps/constants.py#L33\">https://github.com/janeczku/calibre-web/blob/91e36b2c7e1016de5f6b8d90201685ded51f7e0a/cps/constants.py#L33</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/janeczku/calibre-web/blob/91e36b2c7e1016de5f6b8d90201685ded51f7e0a/cps/constants.py#L42\">https://github.com/janeczku/calibre-web/blob/91e36b2c7e1016de5f6b8d90201685ded51f7e0a/cps/constants.py#L42</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/janeczku/calibre-web/blob/91e36b2c7e1016de5f6b8d90201685ded51f7e0a/cps/fs.py#L58\">https://github.com/janeczku/calibre-web/blob/91e36b2c7e1016de5f6b8d90201685ded51f7e0a/cps/fs.py#L58</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Things done</h2>\n\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li>Built on platform:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> x86_64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> x86_64-darwin</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\">